{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"]},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Medical Knowledge Hub","text":"<p>\u0e22\u0e34\u0e19\u0e14\u0e35\u0e15\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e19\u0e23\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e2a\u0e39\u0e48\u0e41\u0e2b\u0e25\u0e48\u0e07\u0e23\u0e27\u0e1a\u0e23\u0e27\u0e21\u0e04\u0e27\u0e32\u0e21\u0e23\u0e39\u0e49\u0e17\u0e32\u0e07\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e41\u0e1e\u0e17\u0e22\u0e4c\u0e2a\u0e33\u0e2b\u0e23\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e41\u0e1e\u0e17\u0e22\u0e4c\u0e43\u0e0a\u0e49\u0e17\u0e38\u0e19\u0e41\u0e25\u0e30\u0e1a\u0e38\u0e04\u0e25\u0e32\u0e01\u0e23\u0e17\u0e32\u0e07\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e41\u0e1e\u0e17\u0e22\u0e4c \u0e43\u0e0a\u0e49\u0e40\u0e1e\u0e37\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e04\u0e49\u0e19\u0e2b\u0e32\u0e41\u0e19\u0e27\u0e17\u0e32\u0e07\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e27\u0e34\u0e19\u0e34\u0e08\u0e09\u0e31\u0e22 \u0e23\u0e31\u0e01\u0e29\u0e32 \u0e41\u0e25\u0e30 protocol \u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e2a\u0e33\u0e04\u0e31\u0e0d\u0e44\u0e14\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e48\u0e32\u0e07\u0e23\u0e27\u0e14\u0e40\u0e23\u0e47\u0e27</p>"},{"location":"diseases/dka/","title":"Diabetic Ketoacidosis (DKA)","text":""},{"location":"diseases/dka/#diagnostic-criteria","title":"Diagnostic Criteria","text":"<ul> <li>Hyperglycemia (Glucose &gt;250 mg/dL)</li> <li>Acidosis (pH &lt; 7.3)</li> <li>Ketosis</li> </ul>"},{"location":"diseases/dka/#treatment","title":"Treatment","text":"<ol> <li>IV Fluids</li> <li>Insulin infusion</li> <li>Potassium replacement</li> </ol>"},{"location":"diseases/dka/#monitoring","title":"Monitoring","text":"<ul> <li>Blood glucose</li> <li>Electrolytes</li> <li>ABG</li> </ul>"},{"location":"protocols/antibiotic_guide/","title":"Antibiotic Guide","text":""},{"location":"protocols/antibiotic_guide/#common-infections","title":"Common Infections","text":"<ul> <li>CAP: Amoxicillin or Azithromycin</li> <li>UTI: Nitrofurantoin or TMP/SMX</li> </ul>"},{"location":"protocols/antibiotic_guide/#considerations","title":"Considerations","text":"<ul> <li>Allergies</li> <li>Renal function</li> <li>Local resistance</li> </ul>"},{"location":"symptoms/chest_pain/","title":"Chest Pain","text":""},{"location":"symptoms/chest_pain/#differential-diagnosis","title":"Differential Diagnosis","text":"<ul> <li>ACS</li> <li>PE</li> <li>Aortic dissection</li> <li>GERD</li> <li>Musculoskeletal pain</li> </ul>"},{"location":"symptoms/chest_pain/#initial-workup","title":"Initial Workup","text":"<ul> <li>ECG</li> <li>Troponin</li> <li>Chest X-ray</li> </ul>"},{"location":"symptoms/chest_pain/#red-flags","title":"Red Flags","text":"<ul> <li>Sudden onset</li> <li>Radiation to back</li> <li>Hypotension</li> </ul>"},{"location":"tools/stroke_checklist/","title":"Stroke Checklist","text":""},{"location":"tools/stroke_checklist/#initial-assessment","title":"Initial Assessment","text":"<ul> <li>FAST: Face, Arm, Speech, Time</li> <li>CT Brain without contrast</li> <li>NIH Stroke Scale</li> </ul>"},{"location":"tools/stroke_checklist/#interventions","title":"Interventions","text":"<ul> <li>Thrombolysis if &lt;4.5 hrs and eligible</li> <li>BP control</li> </ul>"}]}